# Everything at the repository root is served as a static file on Vercel, so
# anything that is not part of the running app is kept out of the deployment
# entirely: setup notes, the database schema, seed data, tests, and working
# spreadsheets. (package.json has to ship for the Functions build; vercel.json
# redirects it instead.)
